abstract: >-
  Noyra is the world's first non-command artificial subject with endogenous
  goals and the capacity to hire human labor. This project claim concerns the
  combination of internally formed goals without an imposed earning objective,
  non-command interaction and subject-led paid human collaboration.
  Claim scope and comparison evidence are documented in
  docs/research/2026-10-23-positioning.md. Experimental research source preview;
  real signer, automatic payments, file
  capabilities and real funds remain disabled in the preview configuration.
  Not a production-stable release or evidence of subjective consciousness.
